            "text": "Our New Bottle Design",
            "size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_xDaF6Q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every element of our newly designed Dunrobin Gin bottle tells part of the story of the landscape and heritage that inspires Dunrobin Highland Distillery.</p><p>Working closely with internationally renowned Italian designer Luca Nichetto, founder of&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.nichetto.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.nichetto.com\">NICHETTO®</a>, every aspect of Dunrobin Highland Distillery's visual identity, from our logo and bottle design to our premium gift packaging, has been carefully developed to bring the Dunrobin story to life through thoughtful, distinctive design.</p><p>The bottle's curved shape reflects the rolling hills of Sutherland that frame Dunrobin Castle, where the fresh spring water used in our spirits is sourced.</p><p>A flowing line represents the beautiful Highland coastline, stretching towards the horizon and reflecting the sea that has shaped this corner of Scotland for generations.</p><p>Our new premium bottle design places the Dunrobin Highland Distillery pictogram at its heart, wrapping continuously around the entire bottle and extending across our newly designed gift packaging.</p><p>Its scale and prominence reflect the grandeur and presence of Dunrobin Castle, while the continuous 360-degree design represents a story that never truly ends, paying tribute to the generations of history and heritage behind Dunrobin.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
